COMPANIES ENJOYING BIOTECH BOOM, PROVIDE BEST OF EVERYTHING FOR EMPLOYEES -- LIFE IS GOOD

Companies in the Biotech and Pharmaceuticals industries are enjoying a boom of major proportions, and are offering almost every inducement imaginable, to hire and retain good employees, as there is a constant shortage of highly-qualified biotech workers, all of whom can "write their own ticket" these days.

